00:01:37.121 --> 00:01:40.591
IT IS NOT MAKING ANY ACTIONS

00:01:38.689 --> 00:01:41.926
THAT WILL MAKE US FEEL LIKE WE

00:01:40.725 --> 00:01:44.595
ARE MAKING A DIFFERENCE, WE MUST

00:01:42.059 --> 00:01:47.165
ACTUALLY MAKE THAT DIFFERENCE.

00:01:44.729 --> 00:01:48.166
&gt;&gt; Jesse: SO, JUAN, YOU WERE

00:01:47.298 --> 00:01:49.800
